   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Club,Washington,DC**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2006-11-28.930_Club_Washington_DC** (recommended): source not stated; 1 songs; 115 min [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2006-11-28.930_Club_Washington_DC**: taped by Keith Sproat and Mark Lynn; transferred by Keith Sproat and Mark Lynn; source: DPA(B&K)4011s->Luminous Monarchs->V2->Luminous Synchestra Signature XLRs->AD2K@ 16/48->Microtracker [1]. Also: Audio processed via AD2K at 16/48, then transferred to SD722 and Wavelab; Final files edited, resampled, and tracked in CD Wave before becoming FLAC [1]",
